
This package is now obsolete.

It is superceded by the ruby-redmineup package, based on the
RedmineUP library GEM:

  https://rubygems.org/gems/redmineup

The packaging for ruby-redmineup is stored in Git:

  https://github.com/dpocock/ruby-redmineup

RedmineUP plugins using the new RedmineUP library GEM can't be
installed at the same time as plugins using the legacy redmine_crm
library GEM.

  https://rubygems.org/gems/redmine_crm

It is important to avoid confusion between the name of this library,
redmine_crm and the similarly named redmine_crm_contacts plugin from
the same vendor.

  https://www.redmineup.com/pages/help/crm/contacts-and-companies

